      "translation_status": "pending",
      "original": {
        "language": "en",
        "content": "Here the method `pygame.font.SysFont` creates a font object, which uses the system font Arial in size 24. The the method `render` creates an image of the specified text in the given colour. This image is drawn on the window with the `blit` method, just as before."
      },
